'''Portals''' are items that players place on their [[Private Island]]. They provide a way to quickly travel to their corresponding destination. While [[Travel Scrolls]] perform this task more efficiently, they are usually more expensive in comparison. Certain Warp Scrolls also require {{Rank|MVP+}}, while all Portals are available to everyone. Additionally to some players, Portals can also serve a decorative purpose. 

